<programme start="20261107000000 +0000" stop="20261107020000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Saint Louis vs. Missouri</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Saint Louis Billikens and the Missouri Tigers meet at Enterprise Center for a regular-season game. Saint Louis won against Lehigh 92-67 where Kellen Thames scored 15 points, while Missouri relies on Annor Boateng along with home court advantage.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107020000 +0000" stop="20261107040000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">Middle Tennessee at Kansas</sub-title><desc lang="en">Kansas Jayhawks clash with Middle Tennessee State Blue Raiders in regular NCAA play. Kansas looks to sustain form after posting 15 assists in a 95-65 win, while Middle Tennessee relies on perimeter spacing after 25 assists in a 117-73 triumph.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
