<programme start="20261107050000 +0000" stop="20261107080000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">South Florida at East Carolina</sub-title><desc lang="en">The South Florida Bulls (6-2) visit the East Carolina Pirates (4-4) at Dowdy-Ficklen Stadium for an American Conference matchup. South Florida seeks its third straight win after beating UAB 30-10, while East Carolina enters after beating Temple 17-9.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107080000 +0000" stop="20261107110000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">TCU at Arizona</sub-title><desc lang="en">The TCU Horned Frogs (4-4) face the No. 24 Arizona Wildcats (6-2) at Casino Del Sol Stadium in a Big 12 matchup. TCU enters after defeating Kansas 22-16 behind Jaden Craig, while Arizona fell 34-26 to Texas Tech and relies on quarterback Noah Fifita.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ak.jpg"/></programme>
