<programme start="20261107051800 +0000" stop="20261107062100 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">New Kids in the Wild</title><sub-title lang="en">Lyca the Painted Wolf</sub-title><desc lang="en">In central Namibia, a pack of painted wolves roams the arid land; amid threats from lions and drought, a plucky little pup called Lyca has to grow up fast, learn the skills of a hunter and find her place as a member of the pack.</desc><credits><director>Tom Barton-Humphreys</director></credits><date>20211019</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/662f055b9a4bb2eada36577b1c988ca4.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107062100 +0000" stop="20261107072300 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">The Great Elephant Tale</title><sub-title lang="en">The Great Elephant Tale</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Great Elephant Tale follows three stories: a calf navigates the Okavango Delta; a bull searches for a mate; and a matriarch leads her family through the desert. These individual adventures tell the story of Africa&apos;s most iconic species.</desc><credits><director>Charlie Luckock</director></credits><date>20230919</date><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/b890ebc92159002b17f4215a037b373b.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107072300 +0000" stop="20261107082300 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Islands: Nature&apos;s Wild Laboratories</title><sub-title lang="en">Baffin Island</sub-title><desc lang="en">For half of the year, Baffin Island is locked in ice and nearly unfit for life; when winter releases its grip, its coastline shrinks and millions of visitors thrive while ice-loving locals struggle to survive.</desc><date>20250604</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/5d35d7bb8de24622e1116a2675f2e40b.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107082300 +0000" stop="20261107092800 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Wild Hunters</title><sub-title lang="en">Weasels and raccoons</sub-title><desc lang="en">Genets, and their relatives the mustelids, like weasels and raccoons, are armed with disproportionate ferocity for such relatively small animals, capable of hunting in almost all terrestrial ecosystems.</desc><credits><director>Juan Antonio Rodríguez Llano</director></credits><date>20240831</date><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/de056ac881e387ede67956ea2e7cb1b3.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107092800 +0000" stop="20261107102900 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Becoming Orangutan</title><sub-title lang="en">Lean on Me</sub-title><desc lang="en">Observing blossoming friendships and interspecies bonds in nursery school; peeking inside a bromance among junior-school buds Valentino, Yutris and Madara; distractible Beni leans into his love of food and gets a beating from a more-senior pupil.</desc><credits><actor>Rebecca Parr</actor></credits><date>20220612</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E02</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/ee9487afdcda89f826ee54176747b1ac06a75ab4.JPEG"/></programme>
