<programme start="20261107110000 +0000" stop="20261107115600 +0000" channel="Love Nature 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Islands: Nature&apos;s Wild Laboratories</title><sub-title lang="en">Borneo</sub-title><desc lang="en">The small stature of Borneo&apos;s dwarf elephants is due to a biological phenomenon; due to their endangered habitat, they have shrunk over generations.</desc><date>20250605</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/2cf262f23a86528d6537f04ac538c05e.jpeg"/></programme>
