<programme start="20261107010000 +0000" stop="20261107030000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">College Basketball</title><sub-title lang="en">University of St. Thomas at Minnesota</sub-title><desc lang="en">Minnesota hosts St. Thomas in an NCAA game at The Barn by Blue Cross and Blue Shield of Minnesota. Minnesota looks to repeat sharp shooting after an 85-50 win, while St. Thomas relies on foul-line accuracy following an 87-point victory on Nov. 2.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Basketball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191260_b_v8_az.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107030000 +0000" stop="20261107050000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">Premier League Soccer</title><sub-title lang="en">Liverpool vs. Arsenal</sub-title><desc lang="en">Liverpool host Arsenal at Anfield in Premier League play. Liverpool relies on fourth-place form after winning back-to-back league games to narrow the gap, while second-placed Arsenal counts on an unbeaten three-match run to capture three road points.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Soccer</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p3605402_b_v12_bj.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107050000 +0000" stop="20261107070000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">Premier League Soccer</title><sub-title lang="en">Manchester City vs. Brighton &amp; Hove Albion</sub-title><desc lang="en">Manchester City host Brighton &amp; Hove Albion in Matchweek 9 of the Premier League at the Etihad Stadium. Top of the table but beaten in their last league outing, City face a Brighton side that has won two of the last four meetings.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Soccer</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p3605402_b_v12_bj.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107070000 +0000" stop="20261107090000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">Premier League Soccer</title><sub-title lang="en">Tottenham Hotspur vs. Crystal Palace</sub-title><desc lang="en">Tottenham Hotspur host Crystal Palace in Matchweek 9 of the Premier League at Tottenham Hotspur Stadium. Crystal Palace won 3-1 at this ground last March, but arrive having lost two straight, while the Spurs are unbeaten in three.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Soccer</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p3605402_b_v12_bj.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261107090000 +0000" stop="20261107110000 +0000" channel="NBC Sports Network"><title lang="en">Premier League Soccer</title><sub-title lang="en">Aston Villa vs. Fulham</sub-title><desc lang="en">Aston Villa host Fulham at Villa Park in Premier League play. Aston Villa relies on momentum after a three-game unbeaten run including a 2-1 win over Manchester City, while Fulham counts on a two-match winning streak to secure road points.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Soccer</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p3605402_b_v12_bj.jpg"/></programme>
