<programme start="20261106010000 +0000" stop="20261106040000 +0000" channel="NFL Network"><title lang="en">NFL Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Chicago Bears at Seattle Seahawks</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Seattle Seahawks host the Chicago Bears in NFL regular-season play at Lumen Field. Seattle enters at 4-3 after a 20-3 win over Kansas City, while Chicago arrives at 5-2 having won two straight, with the most recent 30-24 win against New England.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191277_b_v12_ah.jpg"/></programme>
