<programme start="20261105110000 +0000" stop="20261105120000 +0000" channel="Smithsonian Channel"><title lang="en">Combat Ships</title><sub-title lang="en">Hidden Figures</sub-title><desc lang="en">Stories of historic Black struggle for equality in maritime combat; an enslaved powder boy who served during the French and Indian War; a Civil War gunner; the first African American to command a vessel with a fully integrated crew: Hugh Mulzac.</desc><category lang="en">Documentary</category><category lang="en">History</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p13658854_b_v12_ai.jpg"/></programme>
