<programme start="20261107060000 +0000" stop="20261107080000 +0000" channel="Syfy US"><title lang="en">Renfield</title><desc lang="en">Renfield, the tortured aide to his narcissistic boss, Dracula, is forced to procure his master&apos;s prey and do his every bidding. However, after centuries of servitude, he&apos;s ready to see if there&apos;s a life outside the shadow of the Prince of Darkness.</desc><credits><actor>Nicholas Hoult</actor><actor>Nicolas Cage</actor><actor>Awkwafina</actor></credits><date>20230101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Comedy</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p23068375_i_h8_ac.jpg"/></programme>
