<programme start="20261107080000 +0000" stop="20261107090000 +0000" channel="The Weather Channel US"><title lang="en">Weather Gone Viral</title><sub-title lang="en">Come Rain or Cyclone</sub-title><desc lang="en">Water is a necessity of life but in certain forms, it can threaten it; from surviving a monster typhoon in India and completing a record-breaking free dive to a horrifying plunge into a sinkhole, people are always at the mercy of water.</desc><category lang="en">Environmental</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p11934501_b_v8_al.jpg"/></programme>
