<programme start="20261108000000 +0000" stop="20261108010000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">La tierra prometida</title><sub-title lang="es">Propuesta rechazada</sub-title><desc lang="es">Caleb rechaza la propuesta de matrimonio que Gibar le hizo a Acsa. Samara se rehúsa a olvidar a Josué y le propone a Leia matar a Aruna. Zaqueo le propone matrimonio a Chaia.</desc><credits><director>Alexandre Avancini</director><actor>Sidney Sampaio</actor><actor>Thaís Melchior</actor><actor>Paloma Bernardi</actor><actor>Cristiana Oliveira</actor><actor>Kadu Moliterno</actor><actor>Leonardo Miggiorin</actor><actor>Nívea Stelmann</actor><actor>Marcos Winter</actor><actor>Juliana Silveira</actor><actor>Beth Goulart</actor><actor>Luciana Braga</actor><actor>Raymundo Souza</actor><actor>Ricky Tavares</actor><actor>Ana Barroso</actor></credits><date>20261107</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.81.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E82</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-14</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/00bbbe8642d13ca713aaa82bc6b3270d.jpeg"/></programme>
